  (Δ' : CCtx) (w : World Δ' Δ) (Yf : Mean Δ' (FamV a b)) (q : PathM Δ' (Fam a b) (fmapM Δ' (FamV a b) (Fam a b) (λ q → fst q) Yf) (wact Δ' Δ w (Fam a b) T')) → CSof a (CompE a) Δ' (fmapM Δ' (FamV a b) (TV a) (fam-arg a b) Yf) → CompS a Δ' (fmapM Δ' ((yz : Y) × El a (fam-dom a b (j yz))) (TV a) (λ z → fam-arg a b (j (fst z) , snd z)) (zpt Δ' Γ a Y (Fam a b) j (fam-dom a b) M (sub-wcomp Δ' Δ Γ w σ) Yf (ck-p Γ a b Y j M Δ σ T' tq Δ' w Yf q)))
